16904 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Netflix lacks strong\054 proactive feedback cues that keep users informed about important updates\056\n\nThe notification bell does not display an unread indicator\054 so users have no immediate signal that new alerts or announcements are waiting\056\nExpiring downloads\054 new episodes\054 or followed\055show updates are not surfaced unless the user manually checks the relevant section\056\nSeveral background changes only become visible once the user attempts to watch something\054 creating uncertainty\056\n\nThis reduces clarity and violates Nielsen\220s Visibility of System Status and the Feedback Principle\054 which require timely\054 noticeable system feedback\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 16905 0 R
     /Pg 3172 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

