16939 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Several parts of the app require users to remember information instead of recognizing it visually\056\n\nCast lists\054 genres\054 and metadata appear in dense\054 text\055only formats without visual cues like actor photos or genre icons\056\nImportant details are hidden behind a \215More Info\216 button\054 forcing users to recall who actors are or what categories represent\056\nLists and details lack scannability\054 making browsing harder for unfamiliar titles\056\n\nThis increases cognitive effort and violates the Recognition Over Recall UX law\054 which recommends using visual recognition over memory)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 16940 0 R
     /Pg 3504 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

