16974 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The app presents many options at once\054 slowing down efficient navigation and discovery\056\n\nThe Home page contains many repetitive rows\054 making users scroll through a large volume of choices before finding something relevant\056\nFilters allow only one category at a time and do not support multi\055select options like language or rating\056\nThe \215New \046 Hot\216 page functions as yet another large recommendation feed\054 adding to decision overload instead of offering a distinct discovery shortcut\056\n\nThis violates Hick\220s Law\054 where more choices and steps increase decision time\054 reducing browsing efficiency\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 16975 0 R
     /Pg 3858 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

