17009 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Certain navigation and content structures are inconsistent across the app\056\n\nThe hamburger menu appears only in the \215My Netflix\216 tab\054 breaking expectations that a menu should be accessible from all main screens\056\nOverlapping profile sections like \215Trailers Watched\054\216 \215Moments\054\216 and \215Recently Watched\216 behave similarly but are separated into different blocks\056\nThe purpose of the \215New \046 Hot\216 tab is unclear\054 as it offers recommended content similar to Home rather than a uniquely defined feature\056\n\nThese issues violate the Consistency and Standards heuristic\054 causing users to re\055learn navigation patterns between screens\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 17010 0 R
     /Pg 4196 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
