17044 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Although visually polished\054 Netflix\220s interface contains more information than necessary\056\n\nMany content rows on the Home page are visually similar\054 making it difficult for users to prioritise what to focus on\056\nThe Profile page includes redundant activity sections\054 which increases scrolling and cognitive load\056\nThe volume of content across multiple tabs adds noise rather than clarity\056\n\nThis violates Aesthetic \046 Minimalist Design and increases extraneous cognitive load\054 making the app feel heavier to navigate than needed\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 17045 0 R
     /Pg 4544 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
